{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40681","headline":"对棊 · 李洞","name":"对棊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"小槛明高雪，幽人鬬智棊。\n日斜抛作劫，月午蹙成迟。\n倚杖湘僧筭，翘松野鹤窥。\n侧楸敲醒睡，片石夹吟诗。\n雨点匳中渍，灯花局上吹。\n秋涛寒竹寺，此兴谢公知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40681.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40681","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}